  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds all remaining PDF shading types: function-based, free-form and lattice triangles, Coons and tensor-product patches. Supports arbitrary bit widths, continuation edges, nonlinear color functions, affine placement, clipping, transparency and shading-pattern backgrounds. Adds bounded mesh storage and adaptive tessellation with a spatial triangle index, 36 regression tests and an authored comparison PDF. No new runtime dependencies.",
